From: PS5_Proton <local>
Subject: [PATCH] Windows Zink: present nothing when SwapBuffers has no context

Wine's opengl32 test ended on the console in test_window_dc, both builds: after wglMakeCurrent(NULL, NULL) and
wglDeleteContext, SwapBuffers reached zink_flush_frontbuffer with no context (WGL passes none when nothing is
current), which read address 0x48 (libgallium_wgl.dll+0x6251ca, crash-seh, 2026-10-27). Windows answers TRUE.
PS5_Mesa e7c317df9c11 (zink: present nothing when flush_frontbuffer has no context, one commit on 1ba9874) returns
there with nothing presented; on the PC the test now passes test_window_dc in both builds. 1ba9874's two commits
since b3588f78 (radv/ps5 fragment inputs, wsi/videoout 119.88 Hz) change no file this build compiles.
---
--- a/tools/build-mesa-windows-zink.sh	2026-10-27 07:52:48.455390212 -0400
+++ b/tools/build-mesa-windows-zink.sh	2026-10-27 07:52:48.456066537 -0400
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@
 work=$(cd -- "$work" && pwd)
 mesa_fork=$(cd -- "$mesa_fork" && pwd)
 mingw_archive=$(realpath "$mingw_archive")
-revision=b3588f78dd7fd46fbadc7ecd487e5f14d4213e4b
+revision=e7c317df9c11e25963d07e87d8e908cb5eabb15d
 printf '%s  %s\n' bb7bb7654b33d5aa8712acb837c963b2e0c56352560c76105270a3268c665c21 "$mingw_archive" | sha256sum --check --status
 mkdir -p "$work"
 mingw=$work/toolchain
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@
 root,work=map(Path,sys.argv[1:])
 digest=lambda p:hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
 files={p.name:digest(p) for p in work.glob('build/src/gallium/targets/*/*.dll')}
-manifest={'mesa_version':'26.2.0','mesa_revision':'b3588f78dd7fd46fbadc7ecd487e5f14d4213e4b',
+manifest={'mesa_version':'26.2.0','mesa_revision':'e7c317df9c11e25963d07e87d8e908cb5eabb15d',
           'llvm_mingw':'20260922-ucrt','build_script':digest(root/'tools/build-mesa-windows-zink.sh'),
           'architecture':'x86_64','driver':'zink','files':files,'console_validated':False}
 manifest['zink_source_sha256']=digest(work/'source/src/gallium/drivers/zink/zink_kopper.c')
